      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "hint": "logic-panel-copy",
      "text": "A Vision can only come from a real MyMind card, collection or MyWorld moment. Publishing is always explicit; exact locations stay hidden and every shared object can be saved back into someone else’s MyMind."
